		(uuid "b0259060-8dd1-49fe-8976-f5ea2068bcd2")
	)
	(text "Rev B changes (see docs/HARDWARE.md):\n1. 555 wired as an astable: pins 2 + 6 tied (TIMING); R3 now DISCH -> TIMING (was +5V -> THR).\n2. C2 (2.2 nF across the sensor) removed: it swamped the ~1-2 pF plates.\n3. NE555 -> TLC555 (CMOS) at 3.3 V: output drives GPIO32 directly, pA input leakage.\n4. Flow signal level-shifted (D1 + R4). 5. ESP32 GND joined to the main GND.\n6. 100 nF decoupling at U1 pin 8. Unused ESP32 pins marked no-connect."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0c7b8fc6-37ca-4323-a8b3-a936ba43925d")
	)
